        },
        {
          "text": " Ido koany, kobu ece mamakeŋ, kotema atiar, “Ekesisianakinan, kebusakinit aswam akirot anyoin naejok, tetere adumuni aijar naka ikar kere?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
